{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "14", "m": "11", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "08", "M": "14", "S": "44"}}, "news": [{"title": "India's commercial real estate investment rises 15% in 9M 2026: Report", "para": "In the first three quarters of 2026, India's commercial real estate investment rose by 15%, with cross-border investments hitting USD 5.5 billion, far surpassing mainland China. Grade A office yields between 7.75% and 8% are drawing investor interest. Data centers contributed significantly, reflecting positive overall market trends as the Asia Pacific region neared USD 200 billion in investments, underscoring strong activity.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/commercial/indias-commercial-real-estate-investment-rises-15-in-9m-2026-report/135822702?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-178928/135822702.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "commercial"}, {"title": "Lucknow civic body offices to remain open on November 14 for property tax OTS applications", "para": "Lucknow Municipal Corporation's tax department will open on November 14 for applications under the one-time settlement scheme. Taxpayers may submit applications to recover outstanding property tax dues during this period. All zonal cash counters will also operate normally to facilitate the process. Additionally, Jal Kal department offices will remain open for revenue collection activities. Taxpayers can deposit amounts determined under the scheme until December 15, 2026.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/lucknow-civic-body-offices-to-remain-open-on-november-14-for-property-tax-ots-applications/135822645?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-194838/135822645.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Pune civic body expedites Holkarwadi town planning schemes amid push to aid ring road project", "para": "The Pune Municipal Corporation and district authorities are making strides in urban development, focusing on town planning in Holkarwadi to create a much-needed ring road aimed at reducing traffic congestion. Previous efforts in Uruli Devachi and Phursungi remain stalled due to administrative hurdles. To overcome these issues, a new arbitrator has been appointed to facilitate conversations with landowners.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/pune-civic-body-expedites-holkarwadi-town-planning-schemes-amid-push-to-aid-ring-road-project/135821843?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-406380/135821843.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}]}